    <string name="keepalive_steps">1. Tap the first button and set Kanade System to \"Don\'t optimize\" (or \"Unrestricted\").\n2. On Samsung: Settings > Battery > Background usage limits > Never auto sleeping apps > add Kanade System.\n3. In the recent apps screen, tap the app icon and choose \"Keep open\".</string>
